__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Per-property output folders, named "<gnr>-<bnr>-<kommune>" (e.g.
# 123-9-Etnedal) by property.py's property_code() - manually-captured
# screenshots, georeferenced GeoTIFFs, overlays, and manifest.json are
# all regenerable/re-droppable, so none of it is tracked. Anchored to
# the repo root (leading /) - docs/tiles/<property_code>/ uses this
# same naming convention but *is* tracked (export_web_tiles.py's output
# is exactly what GitHub Pages needs to serve, not a working file).
/[0-9]*-[0-9]*-*/
